WHEN (f$HLFlopBetRaisedCall AND f$HLTurnCheckRaiseCall) RETURN TRUE FORCE
WHEN Others RETURN FALSE FORCE
##f$HLPath2MM##
WHEN (f$HLFlopBetRaisedCall AND f$HLTurnBetRaisedCall) RETURN TRUE FORCE
WHEN Others RETURN FALSE FORCE
##f$flop##
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNuts AND AmountToCall <= 50% PotSize) RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND AmountToCall <= 50% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveTopPair AND AmountToCall <= 30% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND AmountToCall <= 40% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveFlushDraw AND AmountToCall <= 27% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveOpenEndedStraightDraw AND AmountToCall <= 27% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) BetTwoThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHUOpen AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHUOpen AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHUCaller AND AmountToCall = 0 AND Position = Last AND f$SRPTopGood) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHUOpen AND AmountToCall = 0 AND BotIsLastRaiser AND NOT FlushPossibleOnFlop AND NOT StraightPossibleOnFlop AND NOT PairOnBoard AND randomhand < 0.25) BetThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall = 0) Check FORCE
##f$turn##
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopRaiseCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopCheckRaiseCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopBetRaisedCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopBetRaisedCall AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopCheckRaiseCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND randomhand < 0.30) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopRaiseCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND randomhand < 0.30) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopBetCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade AND randomhand < 0.65) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopBetCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND randomhand < 0.40) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopCheckedThrough AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopCheckedThrough AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND randomhand < 0.30) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopCall AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$HLFlopCall AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade AND AmountToCall <= 28% PotSize) Call FORCE
// River rules grouped by 9 independent sequences; existing conservative rules follow as baseline.
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNuts AND AmountToCall <= 45% PotSize) RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND AmountToCall <= 42% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND AmountToCall <= 26% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveOpenEndedStraightDraw AND AmountToCall <= 20% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) BetTwoThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHUOpen AND AmountToCall = 0 AND BotIsLastRaiser AND f$SRPTopGood) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHUOpen AND AmountToCall = 0 AND BotIsLastRaiser AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND randomhand < 0.30) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLTurnDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall = 0) Check FORCE
##f$river##
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2HB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNuts) BetTwoThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2HB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2RB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2CH AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2XR AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2MC AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2HC AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) BetThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2RX AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2HX AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2XM AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPath2MX AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNuts) BetTwoThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBB AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBC AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) BetThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBC AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade AND AmountToCall <= 20% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBX AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathBX AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathCB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathCB AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade AND AmountToCall <= 20% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathCC AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) BetThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathCC AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade AND AmountToCall <= 20% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathCX AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathCX AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathXB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathXB AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathXC AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) BetThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathXC AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade AND AmountToCall <= 20% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathXX AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Check FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$HLPathXX AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPTopGood AND NOT f$SRPStrongMade) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNuts AND AmountToCall <= 40% PotSize) RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNuts) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$HLRiverDomainV2 AND f$SRPHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND f$SRPStrongMade AND AmountToCall <= 55% PotSize) Call FORCE
